["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Mapping Humanity From Space: NASA’s Black Marble with Dr. Miguel Román Black Marble Golden Goose Award VIIRS nadir downscaling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-fromfirstprinc-被当成仪器故障的数据异常-竟是开罗城在斋月里的灯光变化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59727fbf3d73d196-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">48:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>被当成仪器故障的数据异常，竟是开罗城在斋月里的灯光变化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">团队原以为是仪器故障，耗费数年排查后才发现，开罗、安曼等城市的夜间亮度是按伊斯兰历而非公历波动的，异常曲线精确对上了斋月的开斋节。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">卫星遥感</span><span class=\"tag\">夜间灯光数据</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#889: Q&amp;A with Tim — How to Get Unstuck, Resilience in Hard Times, Tools for Brain Health, Finding Inner Peace, Optimism as a Learnable Skill, and More IFS (Internal Family Systems) fear setting hemoglobin A1c Zone 2 training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-timferriss-行动的风险被高估了-不行动的代价才被低估/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>行动的风险被高估了，不行动的代价才被低估</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">写下一年、三年、十年不改变会发生什么，那幅画面通常比你想象中更可怕——这比盘算风险更能推动你做出真正的改变。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为改变</span><span class=\"tag\">阿尔茨海默病预防</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Too dry for cacti: extreme droughts could push iconic species to extinction severe drought model CAD obesity (combined anthropometric definition of obesity) IUCN Red List\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-naturepod-仙人掌没你想得那么耐旱-极端干旱下四分之一物种会丢掉八成栖息地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">24:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>仙人掌没你想得那么耐旱：极端干旱下四分之一物种会丢掉八成栖息地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">仙人掌被当作抗旱标杆，但研究者把极端干旱纳入气候模型后发现，近四分之一物种将损失超过八成适宜栖息地，远超常规气候模型的预测。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气候变化</span><span class=\"tag\">生物多样性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"A New Vision for Human Work After Automation GDPval agency rupture allocation economy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-aiandi-ai-让生成答案变得廉价-稀缺的是你带着视角去追问/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c79a115d7e2b3b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">26:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让生成答案变得廉价，稀缺的是你带着视角去追问</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当所有人都能从 Claude 拿到同样的默认答案，真正值钱的不是模型能力本身，而是你因为责任和视角而去追问出的那个不一样的答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 自动化</span><span class=\"tag\">未来工作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Credit Cards EMV chip Charga-Plate coverture usury law Fresno Drop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-stuffmissed-美国银行1958年给整座城市邮寄6万张信用卡-不用申请/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>美国银行1958年给整座城市邮寄6万张信用卡，不用申请</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1958年美国银行给弗雷斯诺6万居民直接寄去信用卡，不问资质、没有申请——这场豪赌几乎让银行赔到破产，却意外开启了全国性信用卡时代。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用卡</span><span class=\"tag\">消费金融</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Agents That Think Together: Cisco&#x27;s Vijoy Pandey on Semantic Alignment, Scope, Accord &amp; Concord Internet of Cognition Scope Accord / Concord GATs / COGs neuralese / latent space communication\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-cogrev-多智能体系统仪表盘全绿-但任务完成率为零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0ad67f662e5c86c3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>多智能体系统仪表盘全绿，但任务完成率为零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cisco发现一个多智能体系统在仪表盘上显示66%在线、运行正常，实际任务完成率却是0%——因为现有监控只检查连接状态，不检查语义是否对齐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多智能体系统</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What the Internet Boom Teaches Us About the AI Buildout | Mike Volpi WDM stat-muxing neocloud KV cache model router\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-a16z-ai算力终将被用尽-但资产的主人很可能会换人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>AI算力终将被用尽，但资产的主人很可能会换人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">上一轮光纤泡沫里，负债最重的公司率先破产，但光纤资产被别人接手后照样好用；Mike Volpi 认为这轮 GPU 建设会重演同一剧本——资产会被充分利用，归属权却很可能换人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力周期</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU资产</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vol.135律政佳人转行卖馒头 年入4亿 聊聊早餐创新的秘密 PB\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-nengzheduolao-水饺有巨头-包子馒头没有-因为机器学不会捏褶子的手感/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08bfa83c9f3d2123-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"能\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">能者多唠｜商业原声</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>水饺有巨头，包子馒头没有，因为机器学不会捏褶子的手感</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">水饺汤圆早被思念三全这样的巨头规模化吃下，包子馒头却因为发面要靠手工捏褶，机械做不出那种蓬松感，十年来始终留给小品牌生存空间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品消费</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Zach Reitano - Building Ro and Why Healthcare Should Be 50% of GDP - [Invest Like the Best, EP.500] PBM Overton window demand aggregator strong attract, strong repel\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-ilt-美国医疗的核心病根-病人掏钱-却从来不是真正的客户/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c02f9f6b43abc39b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>美国医疗的核心病根：病人掏钱，却从来不是真正的客户</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ro创始人认为医疗支出该尽量高，因为真问题不是花了多少钱，而是病人从没当过真正的客户——GLP-1用现金自付证明了这一点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗</span><span class=\"tag\">GLP-1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Perfect Storm That Clobbered Hedge Funds multi-strat / pod negative gamma CTA de-grossing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-oddlots-标榜-不相关-的对冲基金-十月却因同押ai集体巨亏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">51:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>标榜「不相关」的对冲基金，十月却因同押AI集体巨亏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十月里几乎所有主流策略的对冲基金同时亏钱，说明过去一年多数人赚的其实是隐性做多AI的钱，而非真正分散的策略收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">对冲基金</span><span class=\"tag\">多策略基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Chickenology (HENS &amp; ROOSTERS) Part 2 Encore with Tove Danovich pecking order lash egg bumblefoot broody gizzard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-ologies-公鸡其实没有阴茎-一个叫bmp4的蛋白质在胚胎期把它杀死了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">47:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>公鸡其实没有阴茎：一个叫BMP4的蛋白质在胚胎期把它杀死了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">鸡蛋的颜色、受精与否、营养价值几乎都由品种决定而非「天然程度」，但工业化养殖为效率牺牲了孵蛋本能，也让断喙和啄癖成为普遍争议。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">后院养鸡</span><span class=\"tag\">动物行为</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vol.35 对话朱啸虎：Personal Agent 是个伪需求？ Personal Agent ARR Vibe Coding Open-weight model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-guijilichang-你自己都没有秘书-为什么需要一个ai秘书/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38d8d27c2f34d3c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅基立场</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>你自己都没有秘书，为什么需要一个AI秘书</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱啸虎认为日常工作99.9%不需要顶级大模型，开源模型的token消耗量终将超过闭源；但Personal Agent缺少高频场景，很可能重蹈十年前补贴打车的覆辙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI应用</span><span class=\"tag\">基座模型经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"20.建筑师戚山山：人生不是“既要又要还要”，而是“我就要这个” safe play\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-tanpai-建筑师不与别人竞争-只跟一百个自己赛跑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/68d3da25c54fc635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"摊\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">摊牌｜创业观察</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>建筑师不与别人竞争，只跟一百个自己赛跑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她说自己从不觉得在卷，是因为压根没有要卷的对象——建筑师戚山山的生命力不是自律撑出来的，而是先问自己到底喜不喜欢，再决定做不做。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">建筑</span><span class=\"tag\">女性创业者</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Freedom vs. Safety: Axon CEO Rick Smith on the Future of Policing ALPR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-allin-axon-ceo-警用无人机未来该配非致命武器-而不是枪/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/561dcd474c610c53-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>Axon CEO:警用无人机未来该配非致命武器，而不是枪</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Axon 主张用无人机和机器人搭载非致命武器取代警察持枪对峙，开火权仍归人类，但要多人实时审批才能启动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">安防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">创业史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Episode 344: Philosophy as Dialogue Seventh Letter aporetic dialogue divine madness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-verybad-柏拉图说真正的哲学教诲根本不能被写下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de9fabd2316045b0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>柏拉图说真正的哲学教诲根本不能被写下来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">柏拉图在《第七封信》里说自己从未写下真正的哲学教诲，因为哲学不完全是命题，而是一种经验；对话体之所以存在，正是为了承载写不下来的那部分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">柏拉图</span><span class=\"tag\">哲学方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Designing for Agents — Zeno Rocha, Resend MCP AEO/GEO Domain Connect SES llms.txt\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-latentspace-体量大100倍的对手-却被下载量反超-规模不是护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/af0f478aa0a3653b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>体量大100倍的对手，却被下载量反超：规模不是护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">没有邮件背景的创始人靠产品体验把下载量反超，而发明DevRel的Twilio收购SendGrid后却把它晾在一边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">邮件基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">MCP</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Neuron Basis: Goodfire&#x27;s Curt Tigges on Agentic Interp, Monosemanticity &amp; Reverse Engineering gated MLP (SwiGLU) monosemanticity ablation SAE (sparse autoencoder) neuron scientist\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-cogrev-单个神经元的含义没有想象中混乱-智能体逐个审问找到答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd1b0999555e3944-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:56:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>单个神经元的含义没有想象中混乱：智能体逐个审问找到答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">门控MLP让神经元只在少数几个含义间切换而非上百种混杂；AI智能体逐一做实验验证后，能用一段描述准确预测神经元的行为，推翻了「神经元太脏读不懂」的旧说法。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解释性</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Washington keeps helping China catch up in AI | Luisa Rodriguez distillation wakesurfer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-eightythousand-中国ai没有自研超车-靠的是租美国算力-抄美国模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad5a0c87762b8e27-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">26:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>中国AI没有自研超车，靠的是租美国算力、抄美国模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国模型只落后美国约六个月，但这差距很大程度靠境外租用英伟达芯片和对美国模型的知识蒸馏撑起来——一旦美国堵住这两条路，真实差距会比看起来大得多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片租赁</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"HubSpot’s Co-Founder on Finding Your Next Startup Idea Yellow Brick Road second brain context graph evals\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-a16z-chatgpt和claude已是新操作系统-但护城河不在界面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>ChatGPT和Claude已是新操作系统，但护城河不在界面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">HubSpot联合创始人判断：模型正趋于可替换的基础设施，没有人能卡住创业者的供应链咽喉；真正的护城河是沉淀下来的工作与数据，而非用户进入的那个聊天框。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">平台生态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Nik Storonsky: The most uncompromising banking CEO K-factor NPAP (New Product Approval Process) OCC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-cheekypint-revolut-ceo-把银行信贷类比卖期权-收十年租金-一年亏光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9d2ccbd206c41a7e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">51:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>Revolut CEO 把银行信贷类比卖期权：收十年租金，一年亏光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">放贷利润会被经济周期一次性抹平，所以 Revolut 把放贷目标压到资产负债表不到10%、其余证券化出表，宁可做订阅制科技公司，也不做传统净息差银行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新型银行</span><span class=\"tag\">产品运营</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Shadi Hamid and Matthew Kaemingk on Whether Democracy Needs Religion idolatry political hobbyism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-goodfight-政治变得越世俗-反而越像一场圣战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>政治变得越世俗，反而越像一场圣战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两位作者认为，当人们不再从宗教获得身份认同与终极意义，这种渴望并未消失，而是转移进了政治——这正是美国政治走向「圣战化」的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宗教与政治</span><span class=\"tag\">政党政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How Elon Musk Solves Problems | Jon McNeill battlefield promotion bill of materials weighted ETF Follow Me Home exercise Fire Yourself exercise\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-knowledge-马斯克的产品算法-自动化是最后一步-不是第一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/586a4f39f9c67632-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克的产品算法：自动化是最后一步，不是第一步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉团队曾因为先自动化而在同一个问题上卡住数月：马斯克的算法要求先删需求、简化流程、手动跑通，自动化永远是最后一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span><span class=\"tag\">马斯克</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"515 从铁幕创作到解冻文艺：漫谈世界电影史中的波兰巨匠安杰伊·瓦伊达 Zespół filmowy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-cn2aa250-波兰电影史其实是电影节写出来的-没进戛纳就等于没拍过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>波兰电影史其实是电影节写出来的：没进戛纳就等于没拍过</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者说大卫·波德威尔写罗马尼亚电影史时一个字都没提，不是因为片子差，而是因为那些片子从没被送到西方能看见的电影节。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">波兰电影</span><span class=\"tag\">冷战文化政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Perfectly Leveraged for the Squat progressive overload majestic womanhood manhood stones Title IX\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-10-ninepi-被遗忘的维多利亚大力女明星-当年体重大才被认为又强又美/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">35:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>被遗忘的维多利亚大力女明星：当年体重大才被认为又强又美</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现代人以瘦为美的观念只有一百多年历史——维多利亚时代的马戏团大力女星体重两百磅，却被封为「世界上最强壮也最美丽的女人」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性力量史</span><span class=\"tag\">举重</span>\n</div></div></a>"]